Package: msrlos
Type: Package
Title: Model Selection for r-Largest Order Statistics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Yire", "Shin", role = "aut"),
    person("Jihong", "Park", role = "aut"),
    person("Jeong-Soo", "Park", email = "jspark@jnu.ac.kr", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Provides model-selection procedures for the r-largest order
    statistics approach in extreme-value analysis. The main function ms.rlos()
    jointly considers the probability model and the order r using
    entropy-difference procedures and AIC comparisons. Candidate models include
    generalized logistic, generalized Gumbel, generalized extreme value,
    four-parameter kappa, logistic, Gumbel, and fixed-h three-parameter kappa
    models.
License: GPL-2
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    eva,
    lmomco,
    numDeriv,
    Rsolnp,
    stats
URL: https://github.com/yire-shin/select-rLOS
BugReports: https://github.com/yire-shin/select-rLOS/issues
